  "findings": [
   "The tool that starts a subagent is called 'Agent' in the tool_use block (the init tool list calls it 'Task').",
   "Every line of the subagent (assistant, user) carries parent_tool_use_id = the tool_use id of the Agent call; the main thread has null.",
   "The Agent call is asynchronous: the first tool_result of the Agent tool_use is a receipt ('Async agent launched', tool_use_result.isAsync = true), not the answer.",
   "The end of the agent is a system line task_notification with the same tool_use_id, status 'completed' and summary (the report); task_started opens it. The CLI prints the final result only after that notification.",
   "After the first result line the CLI starts a follow-up turn on its own (init, assistant, result): a second result line with no user message in between."
  ],
  "edits": "Recorded 2026-11-24 with a prompt in Spanish; the prompt and the model's own sentences were translated to English and U+2014 was replaced by '-' to follow the repo rules. No line, field or id was added or removed."
